# The build context of the Dockerfile (the repository root; BuildKit reads this file because it sits next to the Dockerfile and has
# its name): the workspace sources only. Build outputs, node modules and local state stay out, and
# so does anything that could be a secret (an operator key, a configuration, an environment file).
.git
target
research
**/node_modules
web/dist
tools/soak/run
crates/kob-wasm/pkg*
vendor/argent-upstream/upstream
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/kob-executor.toml
**/kob-data
